        "Html": "\u003Cstyle class=\u0022code-analysis-syntax\u0022\u003E\n.docs-content pre{overflow-x:auto;margin:1rem 0 1.75rem;padding:1.25rem 1.4rem;border:1px solid rgba(20,42,72,.16);border-left:4px solid #0e6fae;border-radius:4px;background:#f7fbfe;color:#10263a}\n.docs-content pre code{white-space:pre;color:inherit;background:transparent;font-size:1rem;line-height:1.65}\n.language-csharp .syntax-comment{color:#587287;font-style:italic}.language-csharp .syntax-string{color:#8a3d12}.language-csharp .syntax-keyword{color:#6542a6;font-weight:700}.language-csharp .syntax-number{color:#096b65}.language-csharp .syntax-type{color:#0a6680;font-weight:600}\n\u003C/style\u003E\u003Cheader class=\u0022docs-page-header\u0022\u003E\u003Ch1\u003E[page[title]]\u003C/h1\u003E\u003Cp\u003EModel properties must not use framework validation attributes or the required modifier; validation belongs in service collectors.\u003C/p\u003E\u003C/header\u003E\u003Cdiv class=\u0022public-actions docs-rule-actions\u0022\u003E\u003Ca class=\u0022btn btn-primary\u0022 href=\u0022/Documentation/CodeAnalysis/STXM\u0022\u003E\u003Cspan class=\u0022k-icon k-i-arrow-left\u0022\u003E\u003C/span\u003EBack to STXM rules\u003C/a\u003E\u003Ca class=\u0022btn btn-secondary\u0022 href=\u0022https://github.com/hassanhabib/The-Standard/blob/master/0.%20Introduction/0.1%20Purposing%2C%20Modeling%20%26%20Simulation.md\u0022 target=\u0022_blank\u0022 rel=\u0022noreferrer\u0022\u003E\u003Cspan class=\u0022k-icon k-i-book\u0022\u003E\u003C/span\u003ERead The Standard source\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\u003Ch2\u003EWhat The Standard says\u003C/h2\u003E\u003Cp\u003EModel properties must not use framework validation attributes or the required modifier; validation belongs in service collectors. The analyser reports this as a warning at the declaration or statement that needs attention.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Ch2\u003EWhy it matters\u003C/h2\u003E\u003Cp\u003EThis rule belongs to the Models family. Following it keeps responsibilities and intent visible to readers, tooling and future maintainers.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Ch2\u003EBad code example\u003C/h2\u003E\u003Cpre\u003E\u003Ccode class=\u0022language-csharp\u0022\u003E\u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-comment\u0022\u003E// Violates STXM003: Model properties must not use framework validation attributes or the required modifier; validation belongs in service collectors.\u003C/span\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-keyword\u0022\u003Eclass\u003C/span\u003E \u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-type\u0022\u003EStudent\u003C/span\u003E\n{\n    [\u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-type\u0022\u003ERequired\u003C/span\u003E]\n    \u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-keyword\u0022\u003Epublic\u003C/span\u003E required \u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-keyword\u0022\u003Estring\u003C/span\u003E \u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-type\u0022\u003EFirstName\u003C/span\u003E { get; set; }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\u003Ch2\u003EGood code example\u003C/h2\u003E\u003Cpre\u003E\u003Ccode class=\u0022language-csharp\u0022\u003E\u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-comment\u0022\u003E// Follows STXM003\u003C/span\u003E\n\u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-keyword\u0022\u003Eclass\u003C/span\u003E \u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-type\u0022\u003EStudent\u003C/span\u003E\n{\n    \u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-keyword\u0022\u003Epublic\u003C/span\u003E \u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-keyword\u0022\u003Estring\u003C/span\u003E \u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-type\u0022\u003EFirstName\u003C/span\u003E { get; set; }\n}\n\npartial \u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-keyword\u0022\u003Eclass\u003C/span\u003E \u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-type\u0022\u003EStudentService\u003C/span\u003E\n{\n    \u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-keyword\u0022\u003Epublic\u003C/span\u003E \u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-type\u0022\u003EValueTask\u003C/span\u003E\u0026lt;\u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-type\u0022\u003EStudent\u003C/span\u003E\u0026gt; \u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-type\u0022\u003EAddStudentAsync\u003C/span\u003E(\u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-type\u0022\u003EStudent\u003C/span\u003E newStudent) =\u0026gt;\n        \u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-type\u0022\u003ETryCatch\u003C/span\u003E(\u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-keyword\u0022\u003Easync\u003C/span\u003E () =\u0026gt;\n        {\n            \u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-type\u0022\u003EValidateStudentOnAdd\u003C/span\u003E(newStudent: newStudent);\n            \u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-keyword\u0022\u003Ereturn\u003C/span\u003E \u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-keyword\u0022\u003Eawait\u003C/span\u003E studentBroker.\u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-type\u0022\u003EInsertStudentAsync\u003C/span\u003E(newStudent: newStudent);\n        });\n\n    \u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-keyword\u0022\u003Eprivate\u003C/span\u003E \u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-keyword\u0022\u003Estatic\u003C/span\u003E \u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-keyword\u0022\u003Evoid\u003C/span\u003E \u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-type\u0022\u003EValidateStudentOnAdd\u003C/span\u003E(\u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-type\u0022\u003EStudent\u003C/span\u003E newStudent) =\u0026gt;\n        \u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-type\u0022\u003EValidate\u003C/span\u003E(\n            message: \u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-string\u0022\u003E\u0026quot;Student is invalid.\u0026quot;\u003C/span\u003E,\n            (\u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-type\u0022\u003ERule\u003C/span\u003E: \u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-type\u0022\u003EIsInvalid\u003C/span\u003E(newStudent.\u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-type\u0022\u003EFirstName\u003C/span\u003E), \u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-type\u0022\u003EParameter\u003C/span\u003E: nameof(\u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-type\u0022\u003EStudent\u003C/span\u003E.\u003Cspan class=\u0022syntax-type\u0022\u003EFirstName\u003C/span\u003E)));\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E"
