  {
    "Path": "Documentation/Security/ForgottenYourPassword",
    "Name": "Forgotten Your Password",
    "ResourceKey": "Default",
    "ShowOnMenus": true,
    "Order": 10,
    "LastUpdated": "2026-07-21T17:13:46.0940311\u002B01:00",
    "Layout": "Documentation",
    "Contents": [
      {
        "CultureId": "",
        "Name": "body",
        "Html": "\u003Cheader class=\u0022docs-page-header\u0022\u003E\u003Ch1\u003E[page[title]]\u003C/h1\u003E\u003Cp\u003E[page[description]]\u003C/p\u003E\u003C/header\u003E\u003Cdiv class=\u0022documentation\u0022\u003E\n\t\u003Ch2\u003EForgotten your Password? \u003C/h2\u003E\n\t\u003Cp\u003EWhen you visit your portal in your browser, the first page you\u0026rsquo;re greeted with is the login\n        page that looks something like this:\u003C/p\u003E\n\t\u003Cimg src=\u0022[app[root]]Api/DMS/Content/Documentation/SSO Documentation/Forgot your Password/LoginPage-en.png\u0022 style=\u0022display:block;\u0022 height=\u0022469\u0022/\u003E\n\t\u003Cp\u003EIf you are having trouble signing into your account, you can click the \u003Cstrong\u003E\u0026ldquo;Forgot\n Password\u0026rdquo;\u003C/strong\u003E button\n        that is underneath the \u003Cstrong\u003E\u0026ldquo;User\u0026rdquo;\u003C/strong\u003E and \u003Cstrong\u003E\u0026ldquo;Password\u0026rdquo;\u003C/strong\u003E fields. This will bring up a\n        dialog that looks something like this:\n    \u003C/p\u003E\n\t\u003Cimg src=\u0022[app[root]]Api/DMS/Content/Documentation/SSO Documentation/Forgot your Password/PasswordResetDialog-en.png\u0022 style=\u0022display:block;\u0022/\u003E\n\t\u003Cp\u003EIn this dialog, you must enter the email address which you used to sign up with, this will then\n        send you an email with a link to change your password. The email will come through to your inbox and will look\n        something like this:\n    \u003C/p\u003E\n\t\u003Cimg src=\u0022[app[root]]Api/DMS/Content/Documentation/SSO Documentation/Forgot your Password/PasswordResetEmail-en.png\u0022 style=\u0022display:block;\u0022/\u003E\n\t\u003Cp\u003EWhen you click the link, it takes you to the page to reset your password that looks something\n        like this:\u003C/p\u003E\n\t\u003Cimg src=\u0022[app[root]]Api/DMS/Content/Documentation/SSO Documentation/Forgot your Password/NewPasswordDialog-en.png\u0022 style=\u0022display:block;\u0022/\u003E\n\t\u003Cp\u003EHere in the \u003Cstrong\u003E\u0026ldquo;Password\u0026rdquo;\u003C/strong\u003E field you enter your new password and in the \u003Cstrong\u003E\u0026ldquo;Confirm Password\u0026rdquo;\u003C/strong\u003E field\n        and press submit to save the changes to your password. This will now be the password you need to use to sign in.\n    \u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E"
      }
    ],
    "PageInfo": [
      {
        "CultureId": "",
        "Description": "This page explains the process of resetting your password if you happen to have forgotten it.",
        "Title": "Forgotten Your Password"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "Path": "Documentation/Security/LoggingIn",
    "Name": "Logging In",
    "ShowOnMenus": true,
    "Order": 20,
    "LastUpdated": "2026-07-21T17:13:51.7594066\u002B01:00",
    "Layout": "Documentation",
    "Contents": [
      {
        "CultureId": "",
        "Name": "body",
        "Html": "\u003Cheader class=\u0022docs-page-header\u0022\u003E\u003Ch1\u003E[page[title]]\u003C/h1\u003E\u003Cp\u003E[page[description]]\u003C/p\u003E\u003C/header\u003E\u003Cdiv class=\u0022documentation\u0022\u003E\n\t\u003Ch2\u003ELogging In to the Portal \u003C/h2\u003E\n\t\u003Cp\u003EWhen you visit your portal in your browser, the first page you\u0026rsquo;re greeted with is the login page\n        that looks something like this:\u003C/p\u003E\n\t\u003Cimg src=\u0022[app[root]]Api/DMS/Content/Documentation/SSO Documentation/Logging In/LoginPage-en.png\u0022/\u003E\n\t\u003Cp\u003EHere, you must enter your \u003Cstrong\u003E\u0026ldquo;User Name\u0026rdquo;\u003C/strong\u003E and \u003Cstrong\u003E\u0026ldquo;Password\u0026rdquo;\u003C/strong\u003E to the account you want to access and click\n        the \u003Cstrong\u003E\u0026ldquo;Submit\u0026rdquo;\u003C/strong\u003E button to gain access.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E"
      }
    ],
    "PageInfo": [
      {
        "CultureId": "",
        "Description": "This page explains how to sign in to a cCoder portal.",
        "Title": "Logging In"
      }
    ],
    "ResourceKey": "Default"
  },
  {
    "Path": "Documentation/Security/ManagingYourProfile",
    "Name": "Managing Your Profile",
    "ShowOnMenus": true,
    "Order": 30,
    "LastUpdated": "2026-07-21T17:13:57.5021812\u002B01:00",
    "Layout": "Documentation",
    "Contents": [
      {
        "CultureId": "",
        "Name": "body",
        "Html": "\u003Cheader class=\u0022docs-page-header\u0022\u003E\u003Ch1\u003E[page[title]]\u003C/h1\u003E\u003Cp\u003E[page[description]]\u003C/p\u003E\u003C/header\u003E\u003Cdiv class=\u0022documentation\u0022\u003E\n\t\n\t\u003Cp\u003EWhen you are logged into the portal, you will see that in the top right there\u0026rsquo;s something that\n        looks like this:\u003C/p\u003E\n\t\u003Cimg src=\u0022[app[root]]Api/DMS/Content/Documentation/SSO Documentation/Managing Your Profile/HeaderDetails-en.png\u0022 style=\u0022display:block;\u0022/\u003E\n\t\u003Cp\u003EAt the top the culture selection which allows you to select the language you want to view the\n        portal in. Below that displays the current date and time. In order to view your profile you click on your\n        username, this will bring up a dialog that looks something like this: \u003C/p\u003E\n\t\u003Cimg src=\u0022[app[root]]Api/DMS/Content/Documentation/SSO Documentation/Managing Your Profile/EditProfileDialog-en.png\u0022 style=\u0022display:block;\u0022/\u003E\n\t\u003Cp\u003EHere, your \u003Cstrong\u003E\u0026ldquo;Username\u0026rdquo;\u003C/strong\u003E cannot be edited as this is what you use to sign into\n        the portal, your\n        \u003Cstrong\u003E\u0026ldquo;Display Name\u0026rdquo;\u003C/strong\u003E can be edited and this is what is displayed in the top right as your profile\n        name, \u003Cstrong\u003E\u0026ldquo;Email\u0026rdquo;\u003C/strong\u003E is\n        where you want any emails from us to be sent to, typically this is your company email address. \u003Cstrong\u003E\u0026ldquo;Phone\n Number\u0026rdquo;\u003C/strong\u003E\n should be populated with your company contact number, however this information is not required.\n        \u003Cstrong\u003E\u0026ldquo;Culture\u0026rdquo;\u003C/strong\u003E\n defines what culture you\u0026rsquo;d like the application to be displayed in be default, setting this to French (France)\n        for example will ensure that the portal is in French once you\u0026rsquo;ve logged in. To save any changes you\u0026rsquo;ve made to\n        your profile, you click the \u003Cstrong\u003E\u0026ldquo;Confirm\u0026rdquo;\u003C/strong\u003E button.\n    \u003C/p\u003E\n\t\u003Cp\u003EFrom this dialog, you can also change your password. When you click the \u003Cstrong\u003E\u0026ldquo;Change\n Password\u0026rdquo;\u003C/strong\u003E\n button, a dialog that looks something like this comes up:\u003C/p\u003E\n\t\u003Cimg src=\u0022[app[root]]Api/DMS/Content/Documentation/SSO Documentation/Managing Your Profile/ChangePasswordDialog-en.png\u0022 style=\u0022display:block;\u0022/\u003E\n\t\u003Cp\u003EHere, you must enter your current password in the \u003Cstrong\u003E\u0026ldquo;Old Password\u0026rdquo;\u003C/strong\u003E field and in the next two\n        fields you need to populate them with whatever you wish to set your new password to. Clicking \u003Cstrong\u003E\u0026ldquo;Confirm\u0026rdquo;\u003C/strong\u003E will\n        save any changes you\u0026rsquo;ve made\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E"
      }
    ],
    "PageInfo": [
