        "Html": "\u003Cheader class=\u0022docs-page-header\u0022\u003E\u003Ch1\u003E[page[title]]\u003C/h1\u003E\u003Cp\u003E[page[description]]\u003C/p\u003E\u003C/header\u003E\u003Ch2\u003EAccessing Workflow Designer\u003C/h2\u003E\u003Cp\u003EThe workflow designer is accessed via the \u003Cstrong\u003EBusiness Processes \u003C/strong\u003Epage. Expanding a Business Process will display the workflows that are attached to it, to view the workflow designer for the workflow you wish to edit, you click on the\u0026nbsp;\u003Cstrong\u003E\u0022Edit\u0022 \u003C/strong\u003Ebutton on the row corresponding to it.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Ch2\u003EThe UI\u003Cbr /\u003E\u003C/h2\u003E\u003Cp\u003EWhen you access the workflow designer, you\u0027re greeted with something that looks like this:\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cimg src=\u0022data:image/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAC\u002BAAAAUZCAYAAABZqYrTAAAAAXNSR0IArs4c6QAAAERlWElmTU0AKgAAAAgAAYdpAAQAAAABAAAAGgAAAAAAA6ABAAMAAAABAAEAAKACAAQAAAABAAAL4KADAAQAAAABAAAFGQAAAABKZ/TFAABAAElEQVR4AezdCZBcR37f\u002BV9X19XVVX2jD3TjaoAEQAyPIYfDGc5Q0hwrWyONNfKx1trhtcMh2Y51OMJeORxrb2x4vRu73vBGeO2IvaRR\u002BJDDWsthyZY8Y4vUHBpxOMNjeIAkCJI4iavRjb7P6rp6/1mFhy70NMCulwW\u002BavD7yOq6Xr6X\u002BcnMl1WF/8vX9uhX/vaGWBBAAAEEEEAAAQQQQAABBBBAAAEEEEAAAQQQQAABBBBAAAEEEEAAAQQQQAABBBBAAAEEEEAAAQQQ\\\\u002BU5TVugvE8Afnsyod6xMe3LxdSbimnp8qymFm8G4Pf0KZ5J6Xh6RqcvrxCAv8P6YTUEEEAAAQQQQAABBBBAAAEEEEAAAQQQQAABBBBAAAEEEEAAAQQQQAABBBBAAAEEEEAAAQQQQOBeCzQ1AD976JjSQ6P6K59KaWnyuq6//Zr\u002B8JJ0YyV8MfaeOKH\u002B/Qf0C/vXdePKlN596S29sSDNFcNvs6GUvQPS48/opx8f1BcPZtVxqV8vnL6hf/p7pxrajDJDUmZYf\u002BFPPqwDQzkdHcwoHY/JJrtXef0hXXt/Xm8/d1GZn/m0snu79HjnvN76zg919e339fUzje2qNdbO2BUDOvT5P/609vcmdaA3IdfYrLi3L0U7yWB1VfPT03r97XOanl/WmdnbV/nonw1peGxQf\u002BxPfkqHOjc0lN7Qu3/wL3V2Wvrmux99btgjAggggAACCCCAAAIIIIAAAggggAACCCCAAAIIIIAAAggggAACCCCAAAIIIIAAAggggAACCLSGQFMD8Dv7\u002B9W7b58eOZ7WfEdBXTdSevHqesiSJixdXH1DIxo7vF\u002BPHs7rSlte6\u002B9Jp5ZCbjJMslRaGhnTgQP9On6wU8nYHr070fgZBYlMVsn\u002BYX3